---- ENDF/B-VIII.1    MATERIAL 8000         REVISION 1            8000 1451
----- THERMAL NEUTRON SCATTERING DATA                             8000 1451
------ ENDF-6                                                     8000 1451
                                                                  8000 1451
  Temperatures = 293.6 400 500 600 700 800 900 K                  8000 1451
                                                                  8000 1451
 HISTORY                                                          8000 1451
 -------                                                          8000 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8000 1451
 (LEIP) group at North Carolina State University, USA. The        8000 1451
 thermal scattering law data for uranium metal was developed      8000 1451
 using molecular dynamics (MD) with lattice dynamics [1]. The     8000 1451
 coherent elastic cross sections were calculated based on the     8000 1451
 experimental lattice constants. Free atom cross sections were    8000 1451
 taken from ENDF/B-VIII.0 nuclide evaluations at 1e-5 eV [2].     8000 1451
 Seven temperatures are available in this library. The Full Law   8000 1451
 Analysis Scattering System Hub (FLASSH) system was used to       8000 1451
 produce File 7 MT = 2, 4 data for U-metal [3]. The coherent      8000 1451
 elastic data were prepared using the cubic approximation.        8000 1451
 MAT=8000 and ZA=8100 are used for U-metal (natural enrichment).  8000 1451
                                                                  8000 1451
